-**Inputs:** A 3D vector $v = (v_x, v_y, v_z)$ of type $T$ (typically `float` or `double`) [S1][S3, unofficial].
-**Outputs:** A normalized 3D vector $u$ of type $T$ [S2, S3, unofficial].
